125
00:14:24,660 --> 00:14:26,800
Choosing the right career can be hard.

126
00:14:27,820 --> 00:14:32,500
Many people graduate from school or college not knowing what to do with their lives

127
00:14:32,500 --> 00:14:35,420
and get a job without really thinking about it.

128
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:42,100
For some things work out fine but others often find themselves stuck in a job they

129
00:14:42,100 --> 00:14:48,580
hate. Your working life lasts an average of 40 years so it's important to find a job

130
00:14:48,580 --> 00:14:51,780
you like and feel enthusiastic about.

131
00:14:52,520 --> 00:14:55,840
Luckily there are many ways you can get help to do this.

132
00:14:56,600 --> 00:15:04,720
The Australian website www.careersonline.com compares choosing a career with going

133
