134
00:15:06,820 --> 00:15:10,560
Before you see a movie you find out what films are showing.

135
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:14,340
The site suggests you should do the same with your career.

136
00:15:14,760 --> 00:15:17,860
Find out what jobs are available and what your options are.

137
00:15:18,900 --> 00:15:21,640
Next, decide which movie you like best.

138
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:26,900
If you're not a romantic person you won't want to see a love story.

139
00:15:27,820 --> 00:15:32,460
In other words with your career you should decide which job will suit your

140
00:15:32,460 --> 00:15:38,680
personality. Finally, decide how to get movie tickets and find out where the theater

141
00:15:38,680 --> 00:15:39,920
is before you go.

142
00:15:40,780 --> 00:15:45,680
With your career you need to find information about where you can work and how to

143
00:15:45,680 --> 00:15:47,140
get a job in that profession.

144
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:50,740
So how do you start?

145
00:15:51,360 --> 00:15:53,400
Begin by asking yourself some questions.

146
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:57,600
Some jobs require you to have certain life experiences.

147
00:15:58,420 --> 00:15:59,560
Have you traveled overseas?

148
00:16:00,580 --> 00:16:05,400
Do you have any extra certificates besides your degree such as a first aid license

149
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:12,020
for example? Your physical state and build can also affect which jobs you can do.

150
00:16:12,460 --> 00:16:17,620
A person for example who is allergic to cats would probably never become an animal

151
00:16:17,620 --> 00:16:23,680
doctor. Flight attendants, firefighters, and police officers have to be over a

152
00:16:23,680 --> 00:16:26,280
certain height and be physically fit.

153
00:16:26,720 --> 00:16:28,280
Your personality matters too.

154
00:16:28,900 --> 00:16:30,780
Are you outgoing or shy?

155
00:16:31,640 --> 00:16:37,480
If you like working alone a job that requires lots of teamwork might not suit you.

156
00:16:37,540 --> 00:16:41,340
Choosing a career can take time and a lot of thought.

157
00:16:41,580 --> 00:16:46,520
However, when you know you can look forward to working in your dream job you'll be

158
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:47,860
